---

## When This Rule Activates

User or agent completes **substantive analysis**: live UI audit · market gap · security review · launch readiness · «تحليل شامل» · «مجلس شورى».

---

## Mandatory Pipeline

```
ANALYZE (evidence) → SAVE (CEEF/MEM) → SHURA COUNCIL → CONSENSUS → ACTION PLAN → VERIFY → MEM
```

| Step | Required artifact |
|------|-------------------|
| SAVE | `تقارير/CEEF-*.md` + `dist/evidence/` |
| SHURA | `dist/evidence/shura-council/council-*.md` + JSON (من `run-shura-council.ps1`) |
| CONSENSUS | P0→P3 table with verify command per row |
| MEM | `MEM-NNN` links to both CEEF files |

**Forbidden:** present «final decision» to user without SAVE + **agent** runs `run-shura-council.ps1` exit 0 (user never runs it).

**Law:** `.cursor/rules/brqosh-shura-auto.mdc` · **Intelligence:** `brqosh-agents/council-intelligence-matrix.md`

---

## Shura Council (12 seats)

Use roles **S01–S12** from `shura-council-protocol.md`.  
**Consensus bar:** ≥9 approve/conditional · ≤1 reject on any P0 item.

**Tie-break:** Security > Financial > Verify > Architecture > Product > UX (same as `routing.md`).

---

## Closure Levels (repeat in consensus)

| Level | Claim allowed |
|-------|---------------|
| ✅ Code | build PASS |
| ✅ Test | dotnet test PASS |
| ✅ Live | FlaUI / manual evidence path |
| ⏭ External | `docs/OPEN_ITEMS.md` only |

Never mix ⏭ into ✅.

---

## Agent Checklist (end of analysis session)

- [ ] Source CEEF saved with evidence paths
- [ ] `run-shura-council.ps1` exit 0 + evidence in `dist/evidence/shura-council/`
- [ ] Consensus sentence + P0→P3 plan
- [ ] MEM row appended
- [ ] User sees decision + actions (not raw council theatre)

